      value: Pepper
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].nameTag
      value: Newberg
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].nameTag
      value: Pepper
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].nameTag
      value: Newberg
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].nameTag
      value: Newberg
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[7].nameTag
      value: Pepper
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: I bet you can't help but notice my collection of shipping packages.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Actually, I was wondering if-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: I've been buying up Christmas decorations and stocking them for the
        end of the world.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: I will go out, but I will go out in an LED-fueled blaze of glory!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: Anyway, have you seen-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Of course, such a magnificent display would render your abode invisible
        to the world-consuming flames.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: That's not what I'm-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: That is but a small price to pay for the privilege of living so near
        to me.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: But-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[5].dialogueText
      value: Frankly, I think it's too small a price. You ought to pay me rent.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[6].dialogueText
      value: And, while we're at it, so should our other neighbors, too.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[7].dialogueText
      value: Nevermind.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194406, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: animState
      value: RightIdle
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194406, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: facingDirection
